viewModelScope.launch – Starts a coroutine associated with the ViewModel. Runs on the Main dispatcher by default.

withContext(Dispatchers.IO) – Switches execution to the IO dispatcher for background operations, such as database and file operations.

After withContext – Execution returns to the original dispatcher (Main).

